hint.duck=The wild ducks overhead only come down to stay where there is water, with lily pads and reeds close by.
hint.duck.rare=No one has seen a rare duck yet. Keep your pond lovely and see.
hint.camel=A camel wanders in when there is warm sand, a few cacti and plenty of open room.
hint.goat=A goat bounds over to rocks it can climb and leafy things to nibble.
hint.camel.rare=A moonlit camel, pale as the dunes at night, visits shelters with cacti where two or more camels are truly content.
hint.goat.rare=A slate goat is drawn to a shed with plenty of rocks and leafy things, where everything a goat could wish for is close by.
